id: pm-github-xcr3
title: Honor caller changelog policy in gated sync and closeout
description: "Use the caller's changelog scripts for gated sync and closeout, and validate regenerated output before publication."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[2]: changelog-unreleased,"gh:unbraind/pm-github#226"
created_at: "2026-11-18T09:38:46.683Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-18T09:59:09.389Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-18T09:39:06.130Z",codex-sol,"Both reusable workflows regenerate after the tracker writes, but inject a pending-release override for changelog:full. Run the declared caller script and its optional changelog:check before the existing privacy scan, then keep the regenerated changelog in the tracker commit. Preserve the no-tracker-change publication path."
  "2026-11-18T09:42:09.908Z",codex-sol,Confirmed tracker_changed in the audit-windows log for pm-brief#224 and the test (22) log for pm-context#222. The baseline closeout discard branch runs only when the workflow has no closeout proposal. Preserve that behavior and keep both changelogs with the corresponding tracker edits.
  "2026-11-18T09:53:26.995Z",codex-sol,"The closeout log for pm-context#222 compares committed Unreleased with the caller check's expected 2026.11.16 heading. Both scripts now use npm run --if-present with no generator arguments, then run the caller check before scope and privacy validation. Tagged and untagged placement cases passed. The candidate includes the regenerated Unreleased fix, caller upgrade documentation, and default-versus-wrapper coverage."
  "2026-11-18T09:59:01.555Z",codex-sol,"The commit Honor caller changelog policy in gated sync and closeout contains both workflow changes, the contract tests, the generated changelog entry, and the upgrade notes. Focused workflow publication and refusal tests passed 4/4. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, docstrings, identity inventory, changelog:check, and the isolated candidate privacy scan passed. The full affected-file command is linked and running through pm test. The final commit is checked in an isolated clone before the branch push."
